heme":"Technology, Digital & Telecom","tier":"2"},{"status":"Laggard / slow","subtheme":"Media, entertainment & out-of-home advertising","tag":"Media","theme":"Services & Media","tier":"1"}],"thesis":"Signpost printed a strong maiden-call year — FY26 revenue +27% to INR 576 cr, EBITDA +65% to INR 147 cr (margin +~600 bps to 25.5%), PAT more than doubled to INR 70 cr — driven by a deliberate shift from low-quality intermediary work to direct, long-tenure advertiser relationships (~75% direct revenue, ~14-yr avg remaining contract life) and a footprint jump from 4 cities at 2024 listing to 32 cities. The key tension is a working-capital stress: receivables jumped ~80% YoY to INR 317 cr on multi-city campaigns needing region-by-region compliance — management is moving to milestone-based billing and promises \"a humongous surprise\" by Q3 FY27, while guiding 20%+ revenue growth and 25-27% EBITDA (with internal aspiration toward ~30% via 6-7% cost-of-services reduction).","trig":[]},"lm":"2025-06","m":1424,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":3,"prev_zone_vpe":0.2,"r":30.2,"s":"SIGNPOST","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"284.3","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"21.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-1.3","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"SIGNPOST"}